H4409G.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:44; 
son of: Hashabiah (H2811); 
father of: Abdi (H5660)
§ Malluch or Melicu = "counsellor"
a priest who returned from exile with Zerubbabel

H4413.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 25:4; 
son of: Heman (H1968I); 
brother of: Bukkiah (H1232), Mattaniah (H4983H), Uzziel (H5816J), Shebuel (H7619H), Jerimoth (H3406L), Hananiah (H2608P), Hanani (H2607H), Eliathah (H0448), Giddalti (H1437), Romamti-ezer (H7320), Joshbekashah (H3436), Hothir (H1956), Mahazioth (H4238) 
§ Mallothi = "I have uttered"
one of the 14 sons of Heman, the singer in the time of David

H4428H.def:
'the king' or a name, Hammelech in KJV of Jérémie 36:26; 38.6- a man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at Jérémie 36:26; 
father of: Jerahmeel (H3396I) and Malchijah (H4441H); also translated "the king"; 
§ A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at Jérémie 36:26; 
father of: Jerahmeel (H3396I) and Malchijah (H4441H); also translated "the king";

H4429.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:35; 
son of: Micah (H4318H); 
brother of: Pithon (H6377), Tarea (H8390) and Ahaz (H0271H) 
§ Melech = "king"
a Benjamite, the 2nd son of Micah and grandson of Mephibosheth

H4435G.def:
A woman living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 11:29; 
daughter of: Haran (H2039); 
sister of: Lot (H3876) and Iscah (H3252); married to Nahor (H5152H); 
mother of: Uz (H5780H), Buz (H0938), Kemuel (H7055), Chesed (H3777), Hazo (H2375), Pildash (H6394), Jidlaph (H3044) and Bethuel (H1328A)
§ Milcah = "queen"
1) daughter of Haran and wife of Nahor, her uncle and Abraham's brother, to whom she bore 8 children
2) a daughter of Zelophehad and granddaughter of Manasseh

H4435H.def:
A woman of the tribe of Manasseh living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Nombres 26:33; 
daughter of: Zelophehad (H6765); 
sister of: Mahlah (H4244), Noah (H5270), Hoglah (H2295) and Tirzah (H8656)
§ Milcah = "queen"
1) daughter of Haran and wife of Nahor, her uncle and Abraham's brother, to whom she bore 8 children
2) a daughter of Zelophehad and granddaughter of Manasseh

H4439.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:17; 
son of: Beriah (H1283); 
brother of: Heber (H2268); 
father of: Birzaith (H1269)
Also named: mal.ki.e.li (מַלְכִּיאֵלִי "Malchielite" H4440) 
§ Malchiel = "my king is God"
the son of Beriah and grandson of Asher

H4440.def:
Someone descended from Malchiel who was a man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:17; 
son of: Beriah (H1283); 
brother of: Heber (H2268); 
father of: Birzaith (H1269)
Group of mal.ki.el (מַלְכִּיאֵל "Malchiel" H4439) 
§ Malchielites = Malchiel "my king is God"
an Asherite and a descendant of Malchiel, the grandson of Asher

H4443.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 3:18; 
son of: Shealtiel (H7597A)(?); 
brother of: Pedaiah (H6305H), Shenazzar (H8137), Jekamiah (H3359H), Hoshama (H1953) and Nedabiah (H5072) 
§ Malchiram = "my king is high"
son of king Jehoiachin of Judah

H4444.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Samuel 14:49; 
son of: Saul (H7586G) and Ahinoam (H0293); 
brother of: Jonathan (H3083H), Abinadab (H0041H), Merab (H4764) and Michal (H4324); 
half-brother of: Ish-bosheth (H0378), Armoni (H0764) and Mephibosheth (H4648H) 
§ Malchishua or Melchishua = "my king is wealth"
a son of king Saul of Israel

H4445A.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:9; 
son of: Shaharaim (H7842) and Hodesh (H2321); 
brother of: Jobab (H3103J), Zibia (H6644), Mesha (H4331), Jeuz (H3263), Sachia (H7634), Mirmah (H4821), Abitub (H0036) and Elpaal (H0508)
§ Milcom = "great king"
a Benjamite, son of Shaharaim by his wife Hodesh

H4447.def:
A woman of the tribe of Manasseh living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:18; 
daughter of: Machir (H4353); 
sister of: Gilead (H1568H), daughter_of_Machir (H4353I), Peresh (H6570) and Sheresh (H8329); 
mother of: Ishhod (H0379), Abiezer (H0044H) and Mahlah (H4244H) 
§ Hammoleketh = "the queen"
daughter of Machir and sister of Gilead

H4450.def:
A man living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at Néhémie 12:36; 
son of: Jonathan (H3129K); 
brother of: Zechariah (H2148Z), Shemaiah (H8098V), Azarel (H5832J), Gilalai (H1562), Maai (H4597), Nethanel (H5417P), Judah (H3063K) and Hanani (H2607K) 
§ Milalai = "eloquent"
son of the priest Jonathan and a descendant of Asaph
